{"name":"Final Straw","hex":"#d0bf9e","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"final straw","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Synonym of last straw."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/final_straw"}],"entries":[{"title":"Final Straw","blocks":[{"text":"Final Straw is the third studio album and major-label debut by Northern Irish alternative rock band Snow Patrol, released on 4 August 2003 in the United Kingdom and in 2004 in the United States. The album is notable for bringing the band their first mainstream success outside of their native countries of Northern Ireland and Scotland. In the 14 months following its release, a total of 5 singles were drawn from it. It is their first album to feature lead guitarist Nathan Connolly and their last with bassist Mark McClelland."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/9/97/Snow-Patrol-Final-Straw-albumcover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Final_Straw"},{"title":"Final Straw Tour","blocks":[{"text":"The Final Straw Tour was a concert tour by Northern Irish alternative rock band Snow Patrol in support of their third album, Final Straw (2003). The band visited numerous venues internationally from 2003 through 2005. The tour is the collective name of many smaller tours and festivals Snow Patrol has played in support of their album. The tour commenced on 13 July 2003, spanned 13 legs and saw the band play over 200 shows, visiting four continents in the process."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/5a/FStourposter.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Final_Straw_Tour"},{"title":"Straw","blocks":[{"text":"Straw is an agricultural byproduct consisting of the dry stalks of cereal plants after the grain and chaff have been removed. It makes up about half of the yield by weight of cereal crops such as barley, oats, rice, rye and wheat. It has a number of different uses, including fuel, livestock bedding and fodder, thatching and basket making."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Rice_straw.jpg/330px-Rice_straw.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Straw"},{"title":"Straw (colour)","blocks":[{"text":"Straw is a colour, a tone of pale yellow, the colour of straw. The Latin word stramineus, with the same meaning, is often used in describing nature."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/Strohr%C3%A4der.jpg/330px-Strohr%C3%A4der.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Straw_(colour)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Snow_Patrol_at_Roseland_Ballroom_in_2005.jpg/500px-Snow_Patrol_at_Roseland_Ballroom_in_2005.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Snow_Patrol_at_Roseland_Ballroom_in_2005.jpg/1280px-Snow_Patrol_at_Roseland_Ballroom_in_2005.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Snow_Patrol_at_Roseland_Ballroom_in_2005.jpg/500px-Snow_Patrol_at_Roseland_Ballroom_in_2005.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Snow Patrol at the Roseland Ballroom on 20 May 2005.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASnow_Patrol_at_Roseland_Ballroom_in_2005.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Lightbody1.jpg/500px-Lightbody1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Lightbody1.jpg/500px-Lightbody1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_conte